      "content": "thanks for that. i'm also a bit worried about the complexity of it all. sometimes there are these little details or \"hidden\" liabilities that pop up during the valuation process—like if there are unexpected debts or assets that weren't clearly documented in the initial filings. how do you usually advise clients to handle those kinds of unforeseen complications to avoid being blindsided by HMRC?",
